Subject: [PATCH] DV GL: reach the GBM context through a GL/GLES alias

The DV paths cast the window system to the GLES GBM context by name.
Route them through one alias, so the same code reaches the GL context
in desktop GL builds.

--- a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoPlayer.cpp
+++ b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/VideoPlayer.cpp
